# ── effect-beta103-bump.patch ────────────────────────────────────────────
# A2 todo2: effect 4.0.0-beta.83 -> 4.0.0-beta.103 (opencode v1.18.32 tree)
#
# Reproduce (in the v1 source tree, a git repo):
#   1. git apply this patch
#   2. mv patches/effect@4.0.0-beta.83.patch patches/effect@4.0.0-beta.103.patch
#      (content unchanged: still applies to beta.103 — js exact, ts offset -3)
#   3. bun install --force --ignore-scripts   (regenerates bun.lock)
#   4. TAG=beta103-bump EFFECT_VER=4.0.0-beta.103 tools/a2/build-v1.sh
#
# Migration notes:
#   - TaggedErrorClass: NO rename needed. beta.103 still exports
#     Schema.TaggedErrorClass (Schema.d.ts:9749, no @deprecated). All 193
#     occurrences in this tree are Schema.TaggedErrorClass — the
#     eval-transition "192 sites -> TaggedError" premise does not apply.
#   - Schedule.both -> Schedule.max([...])  (all-continue + max delay)
#   - Schedule.either -> Schedule.min([...]) (any-continue + min delay)
#     Signature changed from pipe-2-arg to array-1-arg in beta.103.
#
# Compile-error fixes (beta.83 -> beta.103 API diffs):
#   - Context.getReferenceUnsafe removed -> Context.getUnsafe (absorbs
#     Reference default-value fallback; bridge.ts, run-service.ts)
#   - @effect/opentelemetry/Tracer -> /OtelTracer (dist file rename;
#     llm.ts, agent.ts)
#   - HttpApiGroup.Any / HttpApiEndpoint.Any -> Constraint (protocol api.ts,
#     httpapi-codegen)
#   - disableCodecs:true no longer accepts Struct query (raw QueryConstraint
#     only) -> dropped from worktreeCreate endpoint; optional-String query is
#     identity-coded and middleware reads raw searchParams, behavior neutral
#   - Logger.layer R now includes OtlpExporter.Flusher -> provide
#     OtlpExporter.layerFlusher in observability.ts
#   - Schema.UnknownFromJsonString -> Schema.fromJsonString(Schema.Unknown)
#   - SqliteConnection gained required executeValuesUnprepared -> mirror
#     upstream SqliteClient (same as executeValues)
#   - FileSystem.FileSystem gained glob({root,exclude}) -> fs-util Interface
#     widened (union options, PlatformError return via systemError)
#   - Sse.decode error channel gained SseError -> folded back into LLMError
#
# Dependency-graph fixes (bundling failed without them):
#   - @effect/platform-node-shared: platform-node@beta.103 has range dep
#     "^4.0.0-beta.103" which semver-resolves to rc.118 -> catalog entry +
#     overrides pin to 4.0.0-beta.103; http-recorder direct pin -> catalog:
#   - ghostty-web (github tarball, packages/app only) removed: bun TLS
#     verification fails against github (curl works; bun UNKNOWN_CERTIFICATE_
#     VERIFICATION_ERROR) and the shipped warm node_modules already had a
#     dangling symlink. packages/app is NOT in the packages/opencode build
#     dependency chain.
#
